[alph.b -- print the uppercase alphabet.
(c) 2026 Igor Glajcher]
+++++++++[>+++++++<-]>++.<    Writes 'A' into index 1
+++++[>>+++++<<-]>>           Writes the value 25 into index 2
[<+.>-]                       Increments value at index 1 and writes it out |value at index 2| times
<<++++++++++.                 Writes value 10 into index 0 and writes it out
